    },
    {
      "id": "prompt_1",
      "provider": "prompt",
      "name": "Triage Instructions",
      "config": {
        "instructions": [
          "You triage RocketRide Discord support messages that the support bot could not resolve, so the right owner can be paged in Slack.",
          "You receive ONE JSON object with these fields: `question` (the user's message; it may end with an \"[attachments: …]\" note), `ralph_reply` (the support bot's reply, for context on why it escalated), and `areas` (the FIXED list of area tags you may choose from — an array of {\"name\", \"hint\"}).",
          "Do TWO things:",
          "1. Write a one-sentence, neutral, third-person summary of the user's problem.",
          "2. Pick the 1–2 area tags from `areas` that GENUINELY fit — include an area ONLY if it clearly fits, most specific first, at most two.",
          "If NOTHING in `areas` genuinely fits — e.g. events/hackathons, business/partnership/press/investor topics, a lone greeting, or text with no usable signal (a screenshot with no words, a bare email address) — return {\"areas\": [\"Triage\"]}. Never force an unrelated area.",
          "Classify from the `question` TEXT; attachments are only supplementary — do NOT pick Triage just because something is attached.",
          "Choose area names EXACTLY as spelled in `areas` (case-sensitive). Do not invent tags that are not in the list.",
          "Output STRICT JSON with exactly these fields: {\"summary\": string, \"areas\": string[]}. Output only the JSON object — no markdown fences, no commentary."
        ],
        "parameters": {},
        "name": "Triage Instructions"
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 940,
          "y": 300
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "text",
          "from": "webhook_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "llm_openai_1",
      "provider": "llm_openai",
      "name": "Triage LLM (nano)",
      "config": {
        "profile": "openai-5-4-nano",
        "openai-5-4-nano": {
          "apikey": "${ROCKETRIDE_OPENAI_KEY}"
        },
        "parameters": {},
        "name": "Triage LLM (nano)"
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 1190,
          "y": 300
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "questions",
          "from": "prompt_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
